"Everyone wanted to be on this ship." = "Todos querían estar en esta nave.";
"We weren't supposed to be awake." = "No deberíamos estar despiertos.";
"Every single person matters." = "Cada persona importa.";
"Hoping for forever." = "Esperando que dure para siempre.";
"Everybody wins." = "Todos ganan.";
